      paras: [
        "FOUNDR.land Membership is a place to stay connected with founders who do. It follows the work you did in the Founder Reclamation Partnership and keeps it alive, in good company.",
      ],
    },
    {
      id: "fm-how",
      heading: "How it works",
      boxes: [
        {
          title: "What members get",
          tone: "sky",
          items: [
            "A small cohort of six founders, with its own facilitator",
            "A group call with your cohort every month",
